/*
  =============================================================================
  === EXCEL-STYLE HIGH-PERFORMANCE GRID (V16) ===
  1. Extended Frequencies: Added Midweek (MW), Quarterly (Q), Annual (A).
  2. Weekend Shading: Matrix columns falling on Sat/Sun are shaded gray.
  3. Missed Task Highlighting: 
      - Daily Missed: Past days with no log receive a red inset box.
      - Weekly Missed: Past weeks with 0 logs receive a light red background.
  4. Performance Indexing: Weekly completion states are mapped in O(1) time 
     during the Sync loop to prevent scroll lagging.
  5. Schema Integrity: Uses FormattedValues and strict logical names.
  =============================================================================
*/

